  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You've mastered the art of making it easy for a catchback to receive your passes, regardless of their skill or distance. If you've <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aimed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Aimed\">Aimed</a> with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> weapon or object, you reduce the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> by one category for the purposes of that attack roll (for example, from Medium to Short Range). Additionally, if an ally has <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Readied_an_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Readied an Action\">Readied an Action</a> to receive a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Thrown\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Thrown\">Thrown</a> weapon or object from you, you can throw it to them as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a>, provided you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Aim\" title=\"Aim\">Aim</a> and the weapon or object is at least one size category smaller than you. This throw is automatically successful. At GM discretion, some objects may not be aerodynamic enough to work with this ability.",
